 <skos:altLabel xml:lang='en'>sciences</skos:altLabel>
 <skos:altLabel xml:lang='fr'>disciplines scientifiques</skos:altLabel>
 <skos:definition xml:lang='en'>An academic discipline or field of study is a branch of knowledge that is taught and researched as part of higher education. A scholar&apos;s discipline is commonly defined and recognized by the university faculties and learned societies to which he or she belongs and the academic journals in which he or she publishes research. However, there exist no formal criteria for defining an academic discipline.</skos:definition>
 <skos:inScheme rdf:resource='http://opendata.inra.fr/anaeeThes/'/>
