 <skos:definition xml:lang='en'>a very ductile malleable brilliant greyish white element having the highest electrical and thermal conductivity of any metal it occurs free and in argentite and other ores used in jewellery tableware coinage electrical contacts and in electroplating its compounds are used in photography</skos:definition>
