 <skos:definition xml:lang='en'>wikipedia&#160;: process of water movement through a plant and its evaporation from aerial parts especially from leaves but also from stems and flowers.</skos:definition>
 <skos:definition xml:lang='fr'>wikipedia&#160;: processus continu caus&#233; par l&apos;&#233;vaporation d&apos;eau par les feuilles et la reprise qui y correspond &#224; partir des racines dans le sol.</skos:definition>
