 <skos:broader rdf:resource='http://opendata.inra.fr/anaeeThes/c2_209'/>
 <skos:definition xml:lang='en'>the symbiotic association of the root of a higher plant with a fungus in an ectotrophic mycorrhiza (e g heath pine trees) the fungal mycelium covers the outside of the roots in an endotrophic mycorrhiza (e g orchids) the fungus grows inside the cells of the root cortex</skos:definition>
 <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource='http://aims.fao.org/aos/agrovoc/c_5023'/>
 <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource='http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/5465'/>
